{"id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-clause-semantics.md","title":"Clause and CNF semantics","display":"df-clause-semantics — Clause and CNF semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-clause-semantics","aliases":["72-df-clause-semantics"],"display":"df-clause-semantics — Clause and CNF semantics","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]"],"source_author":"Pavel Pudlák","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter VIII §8.3; printed p.598; PDF p.610; explicit local semantic expansion","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_statement_status":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished","source_proof_status":"Definition clauses and empty cases checked; no external theorem invoked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-clause-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-clause-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clause-semantics — Clause and CNF semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Pavel Pudlák"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VIII §8.3; printed p.598; PDF p.610; explicit local semantic expansion"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Definition clauses and empty cases checked; no external theorem invoked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span> 及补文字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline l\">\\(\\overline l\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为有限子句集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:V\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:V\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ B⟧_a\">\\(⟦ B⟧_a\\)</span> 对部分赋值的类型重载在 Assertion 用零扩张正式定义；使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 求值时要求所求值子句的变量属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span> 与原公式求值取该上游所引用的命题语法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a^0:=a\\cup\\{\\langle p,0\\rangle:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus V\\},\\qquad a^0\\in\\mathsf{Asn}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a^0:=a\\cup\\{\\langle p,0\\rangle:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus V\\},\\qquad a^0\\in\\mathsf{Asn}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ B⟧_a:=⟦ B⟧_{a^0}\n\\quad(B\\in\\mathsf{Fml},\\ \\operatorname{Var}(B)\\subseteq V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ B⟧_a:=⟦ B⟧_{a^0}\n\\quad(B\\in\\mathsf{Fml},\\ \\operatorname{Var}(B)\\subseteq V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v(p):=p,\\qquad v(\\neg p):=p\\quad(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}),\\qquad\nV(C):=\\{v(l):l\\in C\\},\\qquad V(F):=\\bigcup_{C\\in F}V(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v(p):=p,\\qquad v(\\neg p):=p\\quad(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}),\\qquad\nV(C):=\\{v(l):l\\in C\\},\\qquad V(F):=\\bigcup_{C\\in F}V(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_a(p):=a(p),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_a(\\neg p):=1-a(p)\\quad(p\\in V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_a(p):=a(p),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_a(\\neg p):=1-a(p)\\quad(p\\in V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\models_{\\rm cl}C\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists l\\in C\\;(\\operatorname{val}_a(l)=1),\\qquad\na\\models_{\\rm cnf}F\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall C\\in F\\;(a\\models_{\\rm cl}C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\models_{\\rm cl}C\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists l\\in C\\;(\\operatorname{val}_a(l)=1),\\qquad\na\\models_{\\rm cnf}F\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall C\\in F\\;(a\\models_{\\rm cl}C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V(F)}\\;(a\\models_{\\rm cnf}F),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sat}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V(F)}\\;(a\\models_{\\rm cnf}F),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;(a\\not\\models_{\\rm cl}\\varnothing\\land\na\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;(a\\not\\models_{\\rm cl}\\varnothing\\land\na\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源为第VIII章 §8.3，印刷p.598/PDF p.610：子句是文字集合，空子句表示假，反驳从CNF假设出发。这里把其外部真值条件显式展开，不是书中单独编号的定义。空子句与空子句集合的真值不同；含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\neg p\">\\(p,\\neg p\\)</span> 的子句允许存在且恒真。</p>\n<p>所有集合有限；文字正负构造互斥，故变量提取和求值单值。限制一个全赋值到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(F)\">\\(V(F)\\)</span> 或把有限赋值在其余变量处补0，不改变这些子句的真值。</p>\n<p>有限域公式求值采用上式的零扩张；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(V=\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^0=a\">\\(a^0=a\\)</span>，与原全赋值接口相同。公式求值只依赖其自由命题变量，故对包含支持的更大赋值定义域相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Clause}$ 及补文字 $\\overline l$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。$F$ 为有限子句集合，$C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline l","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"a:V\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ B⟧_a","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"a^0:=a\\cup\\{\\langle p,0\\rangle:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus V\\},\\qquad a^0\\in\\mathsf{Asn}.","display":true},{"tex":"⟦ B⟧_a:=⟦ B⟧_{a^0}\n\\quad(B\\in\\mathsf{Fml},\\ \\operatorname{Var}(B)\\subseteq V).","display":true},{"tex":"v(p):=p,\\qquad v(\\neg p):=p\\quad(p\\in\\mathsf{PV}),\\qquad\nV(C):=\\{v(l):l\\in C\\},\\qquad V(F):=\\bigcup_{C\\in F}V(C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_a(p):=a(p),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_a(\\neg p):=1-a(p)\\quad(p\\in V).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\models_{\\rm cl}C\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists l\\in C\\;(\\operatorname{val}_a(l)=1),\\qquad\na\\models_{\\rm cnf}F\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall C\\in F\\;(a\\models_{\\rm cl}C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{V(F)}\\;(a\\models_{\\rm cnf}F),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Unsat}(F)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;(a\\not\\models_{\\rm cl}\\varnothing\\land\na\\models_{\\rm cnf}\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"V(F)","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"a^0=a","display":false}],"bytes":3004,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-semantics|df-clause-semantics — Clause and CNF semantics]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-semantics]]"},{"id":"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{PV}$，$e\\ne x,e\\ne y$；允许 $x=y$。$\\mathsf{Clause}$ 取 [[72-df-clause-semantics]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-clause-semantics|df-clause-semantics — Clause and CNF semantics]]"},{"id":"21921243c3156e00","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,\\mathsf{Asn},\\operatorname{ResRefutation},\\operatorname{Res},\\overline l$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]，$\\models_{\\rm cl},\\models_{\\rm cnf},\\operatorname{Unsat}$ 取 [[72-df-clause-semantics]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-clause-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135"]}